            "text": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef main():\n    X = np.load(\"vectors.npy\").astype(np.float64)\n\n    # Compute squared norms: shape (8000, 1)\n    sq_norms = np.sum(X**2, axis=1, keepdims=True)\n\n    # Compute Gram matrix G = X @ X.T\n    G = X @ X.T\n\n    # Compute squared Euclidean distance matrix in-place: D^2 = ||x_i||^2 + ||x_j||^2 - 2 <x_i, x_j>\n    G *= -2.0\n    G += sq_norms\n    G += sq_norms.T\n\n    # Ensure zero diagonal and handle small precision issues\n    np.fill_diagonal(G, 0.0)\n    np.maximum(G, 0.0, out=G)\n\n    # Compute Euclidean distances in-place\n    np.sqrt(G, out=G)\n\n    total = float(np.sum(G))\n    print(f\"TOTAL:{total}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
